  "question": {
    "text": "If the coefficient of the three successive terms in the binomial expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></math> are in the ratio <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>42</mn></math>, then the first of these terms in the expansion is",
    "image": null
  },
